# old app versions: only the current iPhone and iPad builds are served
# (iphone.html / ipad.html are copies of them). On a new release, update the
# kept version below and its rewrites in vercel.json.
iPhone*.html
iphone[0-9]*.html
iPad*.html
# keep rules last: Vercel matches these patterns case-insensitively
# keep only the newest versioned iPhone / iPad page (plus the routed ones): every old 2.8 MB version kept here
# is uploaded again with every deploy
# /api/models (Poly Pizza proxy) waits: the Hobby plan allows 12 functions; the page falls back to Poly Haven
api/models
